  "wiki/07 人物与城市/生活过的城市/南京.md": {
    "fingerprint": "b00458c3e22791db",
    "markdown": "---\ntype: \"entity\"\naliases: []\ntags:\n  - \"wiki/实体\"\n  - \"实体/南京\"\n  - \"来源/wiki\"\n  - \"类型/wiki\"\nstatus: \"seed\"\nStart: 2017-07-17\nend: 2022-01-19\nlocation:\n  - \"南京\"\nsource:\n  - \"wiki synthesis\"\n\ndemo: true\nevidence_sources:\n  - \"sources/2018-08-14 绩效前夜的工作复盘.md\"\n  - \"sources/2022-01-19 离开南京的工作.md\"\n---\n# Nanjing: engineering training and leaving\n\n## City role\n\nNanjing is the city of becoming an engineer from a student. Work pressure, real technical training, and colleagues willing to guide him are all here.\n\n## Key experience and goodbye\n\nHe gradually saw both the gains and the drain of a familiar setting, and finally chose to leave. Saying goodbye to this city does not require denying the help he received; [[程工]] stands for support that was real in this stretch.\n\nRelated: [[通信大厂：从硬扛到主动选择]] · [[离开熟悉的职业环境]] · [[杭州]]"
  },
  "wiki/07 人物与城市/生活过的城市/哈尔滨.md": {
    "fingerprint": "18ddd636b2aec707",
    "markdown": "---\ntype: \"entity\"\naliases: []\ntags:\n  - \"wiki/实体\"\n  - \"实体/哈尔滨\"\n  - \"来源/wiki\"\n  - \"类型/wiki\"\nstatus: \"seed\"\nStart: 2013-09-01\nend: 2017-06-15\nlocation:\n  - \"哈尔滨\"\nsource:\n  - \"wiki synthesis\"\n\ndemo: true\nevidence_sources:\n  - \"sources/2014-05-27 在自习室回想高考.md\"\n  - \"sources/2015-10-21 在学生组织里被信任.md\"\n---\n# Harbin: first time carrying a community\n\n## City role\n\nHarbin holds the college years: from a new start after exams, into responsibility in a student tech group and a long stretch of journaling. The city name stays; school and address stay private.\n\n## Everyday fragments and lasting effect\n\nIn the student group, work was no longer only personal performance — it also affected whether others could continue. Looking back years later, this city holds study, relationships, confusion, and growth — not just one line of education on a resume.\n\nRelated: [[大学：从参与者到承担者]] · [[在学生组织承担责任]]"
  },
  "wiki/07 人物与城市/生活过的城市/杭州.md": {
    "fingerprint": "281f89a5d4bbbbcd",
    "markdown": "---\ntype: \"entity\"\naliases: []\ntags:\n  - \"wiki/实体\"\n  - \"实体/杭州\"\n  - \"来源/wiki\"\n  - \"类型/wiki\"\nstatus: \"seed\"\nStart: 2022-02-08\nend: 2026-09-20\nlocation:\n  - \"杭州\"\nsource:\n  - \"wiki synthesis\"\n\ndemo: true\nevidence_sources:\n  - \"sources/2022-02-08 到新城市上班.md\"\n  - \"sources/2026-04-21 搬家后的客厅.md\"\n---\n# Hangzhou: career chances and everyday life\n\n## City role\n\nHangzhou first meant a new platform and new work chances, and also rebuilding an after-work rhythm. The career setting changed; loneliness and a sense of freedom can both be true.\n\n## Lasting effect\n\nHere, work responsibility, important relationships, and ordinary days gradually tangle together. The city is not only a backdrop for work; it reminds him that choosing a career is also choosing how each day is lived.\n\n[[演示场景：搬到杭州后的周末]] uses a fictional photo and bill to make that question visible; the dates, spending, and frames in it are not real experience.\n\nRelated: [[互联网大厂：从被看见到有选择]] · [[阿宁]] · [[南京]]"
  },
